From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:23:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] campaigns/erdos-ternary: g001-e02 C engine (lemma-3 child
 pruning, short products)

search/c2/engine.c + core.inc: DFS in C, v = 2^r mod 3^(19*NL) in base-3^19 limbs.
Dead child decided from trit k and r mod 2 (lemma 3) before any multi-limb work;
j=0 child reuses v; j=1,2 child = v + v*(g_k^j - 1) mod 3^L, a short product since
g_k^j - 1 has zero limbs below k/19; past the last branching level only j=0 chains
remain (trit reads only); slow-path recomputation mod 3^266 beyond the fast precision
(depth limit 265), N < 2^120 via unsigned __int128.
search/run.py: same CLI and JSON as g0; compiles the engine into build/ on first use.

T0: PASS (with brute). T1 N=2*3^24: 6.8471e+07 events/s single core (mean of 3),
4 shards 2.0460e+08 events/s; output equals verify/tree_ref.py 2*3^24 0 1.

